	$g_aRunPlannerOptions[12][$eRunPlannerOptionDescription] = "Runs one terminal training pass on the exact active profile and emulator instance. The plan must name the recipe, carry its 64-hex digest, and cap the missing unit count. The inherited TrainSystem, Quick Train, boosts, deletion/rebalancing, spells, sieges, donations, collectors, upgrades, matchmaking, retries, gems, and purchases remain unreachable."
